  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Execution will end once the scheduler shuts down or the returned\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledFuture</code></a> gets cancelled.",
      "translation": "执行将在调度器关闭或返回的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledFuture</code></a>被取消时结束。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>task</code> - the Runnable to execute whenever the trigger fires",
      "translation": "<code>task</code> - 每次触发器触发时执行的 Runnable。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledFuture</code></a> representing pending execution of the task",
      "translation": "一个代表任务待执行状态的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledFuture.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledFuture</code></a>",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Will accept any scheduling request but never actually execute it.",
      "translation": "将接受任何调度请求，但永远不会实际执行它。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>trigger</code> - an implementation of the <a href=\"../Trigger.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>Trigger</code></a> interface,\nfor example, a <a href=\"CronTrigger.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.support\"><code>CronTrigger</code></a> object\nwrapping a cron expression",
      "translation": "<code>trigger</code> - 一个实现了<a href=\"../Trigger.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>Trigger</code></a>接口的实现，例如，一个包装了 cron 表达式的<a href=\"CronTrigger.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.support\"><code>CronTrigger</code></a>对象",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>startTime</code> - the desired first execution time for the task\n(if this is in the past, the task will be executed immediately, i.e. as soon as possible)",
      "translation": "<code>startTime</code> - 任务的期望首次执行时间（如果该时间在当前之前，任务将立即执行，即尽可能早地执行）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>period</code> - the interval between successive executions of the task",
      "translation": "<code>period</code> - 任务连续执行之间的间隔",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>delay</code> - the delay between the completion of one execution and the start of the next",
      "translation": "<code>delay</code> - 一次执行完成与下一次开始之间的延迟时间",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
